  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-21T19:16:37.365Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently with the new update the IK has been set to calculate only for your own character with IK of other people being received through transmisison.\nHowever this results in choppy playback when there's limits on the connection. \n\nThis feature is funest to any dance related event as no longer dances will look impressive and entertaining, instead they will look choppy and glitchy.\n\nHaving the ability to force certain avatars to calculate IK locally (or do this automatically based on user proximity) will allow for specific avatars to still calculate their IK's locally and smoothly so dances and other motion based events are not hampered by this new feature.",
